{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Data Validation Methods "}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear and use when you are talking about data validation."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Designs the data structure based on the database structures and its characteristics.  Validates database using the proper IT tools."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Exchanges simple information on the data validation and data warehouses."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n5le02ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "<strong>Used to</strong>"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the structure <strong>used to</strong>&nbsp;to talk about past habits."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I used to be one of the professionals that carried out validation processes on the different company's systems."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I can remember that there used to be two parts to any validation method."}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use the expression <strong>used to</strong> introduce the idea that someone had a habit, a recurrent action in the past, which is no longer happening in the present time. It can also be used to describe the reality in the past, without making reference to a specific action of a person.&nbsp;</p> <p>The structure for creating sentences with this expression is the following:&nbsp;</p> <p style=\"text-align: center;\">Subject + used to + verb (base form) + complement.&nbsp;</p> <p>For example:</p> <ul> <li><span class=\"italic\">We used to use this software programming system 5 years ago.</span> (Regular action in the past)&nbsp;</li> <li><span class=\"italic\">That system used to be the best one available in the market.</span> (Description of the past reality) </li>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "<strong>Measured Parameters Checks in Data Validation</strong>"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "The process that takes raw data and transforms it into validated data must follow certain methods.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Different tests are applied to the data in order to validate it. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Check the following chart to learn more about these tests: "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><strong>MEASURED PARAMETER CHECK</strong></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><strong>DESCRIPTION</strong></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><strong>Range Test</strong></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"This validation test compares the measured data with pre-stablished limits and assesses it through different types of criteria. The obtained values can be either positive or negative, reflecting the status of the analyzed data.  Each criterion whose value fits within the limits is considered valid.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><strong>Relational Test</strong></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The relational test corroborates that improbable situations of the real world are not stated in the data without proper verification. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><strong>Trend Test</strong></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The trend test assesses the changes present in different values and criteria in a specific period of time. \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "screen "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to project or show something that was not at sight"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The first one, the data screening, would implement a series of different algorithms and codes to screen all the data values that could be doubtful, resulting in a report of the data validity."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n5le02ob08aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "doubtful "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "questionable, unlikely to be successful or accurate"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The first one, the data screening, would implement a series of different algorithms and codes to screen all the data values that could be doubtful, resulting in a report of the data validity."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n5le02ob08aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "through "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "with the implementation of"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(preposition)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It is one of the validation routines that will measure, through three different tests, various parameters before the values are incorporated in the data base."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n5le02ob08aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "criteria "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "plura